IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LEGACY-BILLING.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  CUSTOMER-ID PIC 9(8).
01  AMOUNT      PIC 9(7)V99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "LEGACY BILLING SYSTEM".
    DISPLAY "CALCULATING CUSTOMER CHARGE".
    COMPUTE AMOUNT = AMOUNT * 1.18.
    STOP RUN.
